<title>USA: Fort Worth cash grain prices.</title>
<headline>Fort Worth cash grain prices.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cash grain prices reported</p>
<p>this afternoon by the Fort Worth Grain Exchange. Rail delivery prices are Texas common points. Export wheat is quoted transit Fort Worth, in dollars per bushel, except sorghum per cwt.</p>
<p>    export HRW wheat     4.5800-4.6800</p>
<p>    export soybeans	7.1600-7.2600</p>
<p>    export sorghum	 5.0200-5.1200</p>
<p>    domestic yellow corn 3.8000-3.9000</p>
<p>    domestic oats	  2.0050-2.1050</p>
<p>    domestic sorghum     5.6000-5.7000</p>
</text>
